    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mi>R</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> are three given points. If the locus of the point <math><mi>S</mi></math> satisfying the relation <math><mi>S</mi><msup><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>S</mi><msup><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>S</mi><msup><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, then the sum of all possible values of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math> is",
